  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Response to emergency health needs in communities affected by cyclone Yaku and the 2023 coastal Ni&#xF1;o phenomenon in the regions of Lambayeque and Piura.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of this project is to provide health assistance to people affected by flooding in Lambayeque and Piura departments. This WHO project provide scale up support to institutions and avoid increase in morbidity and mortality. The project provides humanitarian assistance to 19,202 people, including 6,430 women, 6,328 men, 6,444 children, and including 28 persons with disabilities.</narrative>
  </description>
